The '''Kuudra Loremaster''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Scarleton}} and the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}'s distant {{Zone|Blazing Fortress}} island. They appear after defeating [[Kuudra]] once, and allow the player to obtain the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Boots}}.

== Locations ==
=== Crimson Isle ===
The '''Kuudra Loremaster''' is located at {{Coords|-106.5|126|-817.5}} in {{Zone|Scarleton}} and can be found after defeating [[Kuudra]] at least once.  

=== Blazing Fortress ===
==== Setup ====
To make the '''Kuudra Loremaster''' appear on the [[Blazing Fortress]], the player must first say one of the following lines to the '''Kuudra Loremaster''' on the Crimson Isle:

* {{Rmt|THE BRIDGE IS COLLAPSING, GET TO THE CENTER!}}
* {{Rmt|Those orbs strengthen Kuudra! Shoot them down with your cannons!}}
* {{Rmt|A Dropship! Take it down before it's too late!}}

If done correctly, '''Kuudra Loremaster''' will respond with {{Rmt|&e[NPC] &5Kuudra Loremaster&f: Wow! That is a classic. It's great to meet a fellow follower of Kuudra.}} to verify this part of their quest is complete. The '''Kuudra Loremaster''' will now be able to appear on the [[Blazing Fortress]], based on the following method of appearance.

==== Appearance ====
For the entire 24 hours of every real-life [[w:Tuesday|Tuesday]], based on the [[w:UTC-5|UTC-5]] time zone (which matches EST but ignores daylight savings), the '''Kuudra Loremaster''' can be found in the {{Zone|Blazing Fortress}} at {{Coords|-256.5|146|120.5}}. This can be reached by entering the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}} and teleporting across the void.

== Quest ==
If the player talks to the '''Kuudra Loremaster''' in the {{Zone|Blazing Fortress}} with {{Item|Enchanted Netherrack|amount=1024}} and {{Item|Enchanted Magma Cream|amount=1024}}, as well as over {{Green|1,000,000}} {{Item|Netherrack}} and {{Item|Magma Cream}} [[Collection]], the Kuudra Loremaster will give them the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Boots}} and disappear right after that.

